  "publisher": "FHIR Project",
  "description": "SNOMED CT filter includes from the Czech and Estonian editions, each with explicit code and filter excludes. The Czech edition is only on tx.hl7.cz and the Estonian edition only on term.tehik.ee, so no single server can expand it (see fhir-ig-publisher#1469; compare vs-exclude-sct-multi, which one server can do)",
